      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ❌ **Changes Requested** — `__ec_todo_packed` is exclusively reserved for grandfathered-in structs that have not yet been evaluated for size and offset alignment. New structures MUST NOT use `__ec_todo_packed`.\n\nPlease use `__ec_align*` macros. To avoid implicit padding, explicitly pad the struct so that its size aligns properly.\n\nSuggestion:\n```c\n\tstruct __ec_align_offset1 {\n\t\tint64_t value;\n\t\tuint32_t samples;\n\t\tuint8_t channel_id;\n\t\tuint8_t reserved[3];\n\t} pwrmon_data;\n```\n[🔗](http://go/tj/cns/gg-d/home/tomhughes@google.com/review_trajectories/cl8279638_3f0ef6c2-e2a6-4a4c-979f-30ed1ca3d9a2.pb)",
